 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.232,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "扳手攻击，就是用暴力或威胁，逼持币的人交出私钥，或者转账。",
   "spoken": "扳手攻击，就是用暴力或威胁，逼持币的人交出私钥，或者转账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.052,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 4.15,
   "speechEnd": 9.364
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "这个名字来自一幅漫画。",
   "spoken": "这个名字来自一幅漫画。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.416,
   "dur": 2.856,
   "speechStart": 10.514,
   "speechEnd": 12.442
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "花大价钱买算力，破解不了加密，买一把便宜的扳手，就够了。",
   "spoken": "花大价钱买算力，破解不了加密，买一把便宜的扳手，就够了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 13.492,
   "dur": 5.592,
   "speechStart": 13.59,
   "speechEnd": 18.244
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "密码学挡不住扳手。",
   "spoken": "密码学挡不住扳手。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 19.304,
   "dur": 2.232,
   "speechStart": 19.402,
   "speechEnd": 20.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "攻击者知道你是谁，住在哪，有多少资产，最便宜的办法，就是找到你本人。",
   "spoken": "攻击者知道你是谁，住在哪，有多少资产，最便宜的办法，就是找到你本人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 21.756,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 21.854,
   "speechEnd": 27.877
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "打个比方，你给家门装了一把银行级的锁。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，你给家门装了一把银航级的锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 28.936,
   "dur": 3.984,
   "speechStart": 29.034,
   "speechEnd": 32.093
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "可你的门牌号、作息时间、保险柜里有多少钱，都印在一张贴在网上的海报上。",
   "spoken": "可你的门牌号、作息时间、保险柜里有多少钱，都印在一张贴在网上的海报上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 33.14,
   "dur": 6.816,
   "speechStart": 33.238,
   "speechEnd": 39.13
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "锁越好，劫匪越不会去撬锁，而是等你回家。",
   "spoken": "锁越好，劫匪越不会去撬锁，而是等你回家。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 40.176,
   "dur": 4.632,
   "speechStart": 40.274,
   "speechEnd": 43.976
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "比喻在这里不成立，劫匪要先知道你有钱。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不成立，劫匪要先知道你有钱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 45.028,
   "dur": 4.248,
   "speechStart": 45.126,
   "speechEnd": 48.435
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "而链上资产的特点是，地址一旦和身份连上，余额对全世界公开。",
   "spoken": "而链上资产的特点是，地址一旦和身份连上，余额对全世界公开。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 49.496,
   "dur": 6.024,
   "speechStart": 49.594,
   "speechEnd": 54.677
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "所以攻击的第一步，是关联。",
   "spoken": "所以攻击的第一步，是关联。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 55.74,
   "dur": 3.408,
   "speechStart": 55.838,
   "speechEnd": 58.314
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "把一个链上地址，连到一个真实的人，一个真实的住址。",
   "spoken": "把一个链上地址，连到一个真实的人，一个真实的住址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 59.368,
   "dur": 5.016,
   "speechStart": 59.466,
   "speechEnd": 63.549
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "线索有三类。",
   "spoken": "线索有三类。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 64.604,
   "dur": 2.064,
   "speechStart": 64.702,
   "speechEnd": 65.833
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "公开信息，比如社交媒体、采访、会议照片。",
   "spoken": "公开信息，比如社交媒体、采访、会议照片。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 66.888,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 66.986,
   "speechEnd": 70.878
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "数据泄露，比如 KYC 资料、电商订单、客服工单。",
   "spoken": "数据泄漏，比如 KYC 资料、电商订单、客服工单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 71.932,
   "dur": 5.472,
   "speechStart": 72.03,
   "speechEnd": 76.553
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "还有链上数据，地址的余额和交易历史。",
   "spoken": "还有链上数据，地址的余额和交易历史。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 77.624,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 77.722,
   "speechEnd": 80.853
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "三类线索拼在一起，就能筛出余额高、住址已知的目标。",
   "spoken": "三类线索拼在一起，就能筛出余额高、住址已知的目标。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 81.924,
   "dur": 5.352,
   "speechStart": 82.022,
   "speechEnd": 86.438
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "接下来有两条路，一条找上门，一条攻账号。",
   "spoken": "接下来有两条路，一条找上门，一条攻账号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 87.496,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 87.594,
   "speechEnd": 91.201
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "数据泄露直接交出了住址，所以保护数据，也是在保护人身安全。",
   "spoken": "数据泄漏直接交出了住址，所以保护数据，也是在保护人身安全。",
